5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'm not really sure what to say first. I'll just... try my best to help everyone find the werewolf. Let's please be careful.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this simple. Since we have no information yet, the most logical approach is to observe everyone's speech patterns and reactions. I'll be watching closely to see who slips up.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A logical start, Shion. Though watching for ""slips"" on day zero is a bit optimistic, isn't it? We're all just guessing until the Seer actually does something useful.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Shion and Shunichi that we should be patient. Let's try to keep things friendly and harmonious while we observe each other.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that patience is key. Let us observe one another calmly and see how the situation develops. I shall be watching from the sidelines for now.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Midori. Being friendly sounds like a good idea. I'll just listen to what everyone has to say and try to be helpful... if I can.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is noted. While friendliness is pleasant, it often masks uncertainty or guilt. I prefer a more clinical approach. Let's see if that softness persists when the pressure increases.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're treating this like a laboratory experiment. While I admire the intensity, let's not mistake nervousness for guilt. Some people are just naturally timid, unlike those of us who enjoy the spotlight.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, please don't be too hard on Daisuke. We're all a bit nervous starting this. I think it's important that we support each other so we can think clearly and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"@Shion, while your focus on logic is admirable, we must be careful not to let suspicion cloud our judgment too early. A gentle atmosphere often allows the truth to surface more naturally. Let us not rush to conclusions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Midori... and George. I'm sorry if I'm being too quiet. I'll try to be more useful, but I'm just... a bit overwhelmed. I hope we can all trust each other.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game, Daisuke. Blind faith is exactly what a werewolf relies on to survive. I'm not being ""hard"" on you; I'm simply analyzing the data provided.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your ""data"" is currently just a collection of stutters and polite greetings. If you keep pushing Daisuke into a corner, you'll either break a villager or just make yourself the most annoying person in the room. Let's relax.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, you're right that we should relax a little. @Shion, I understand you want to be thorough, but maybe we can find a balance? A little kindness can help us all feel more comfortable sharing information.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"I believe Midori is correct. A balance between analysis and empathy is necessary. If we create an environment of hostility, we may alienate the very people who hold the clues we need. Let us remain composed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll try to stay composed. Thank you for understanding. I'll just keep observing and hope that we can find the werewolf together tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I've seen enough for today. Your attempts to shield Daisuke are noted, but they don't change the logic of the game. I'll be waiting to see who the Seer targets.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I've had my fill of this ""clinical"" debate for one day. Let's see if tomorrow brings something more interesting than Shion's lecture on data. I'm ready for the real game to begin.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can all get some rest and start tomorrow on a positive note. I'm looking forward to working with you all to protect our village.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a baseline for our interactions. I shall now step back and reflect on today's observations. I wish you all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
