36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Good morning... I hope everyone slept well. I'm still a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to listen. Does anyone have any information from the Seer that could help us?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Directly to the point, then. If the Seer has a result, now is the time to reveal it. Hiding information only benefits the werewolf. Who among us is brave enough to step forward and lead the village?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, always so eager to lead the charge. I wonder if you're actually looking for the Seer, or if you're just trying to force someone to make a claim so you can tear their logic apart. Let's see who actually has something to say.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shion that information is vital, but let's be gentle. If the Seer is among us, please feel comfortable sharing your findings. We're all here to help each other save the village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,George,,"I have a result from my divination. Shion, I checked you last night, and you are human. While your manner is quite stern, I can confirm that you are not the werewolf.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Oh... George is the Seer? That's a relief... I mean, it's good to know that Shion isn't the werewolf. Thank you for telling us, George. Does this mean we can trust Shion's logic now?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,"It was a predictable choice, George. Checking the most provocative player first is a sound strategy to clear the board. Now that my identity is confirmed, my analysis carries more weight. Who else did you consider divining?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, a very safe play. Clearing the loudest person in the room certainly simplifies things. Though I must wonder, did you choose Shion because you suspected them, or because you wanted an easy win for the village?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@George, thank you for sharing that so quickly. It's a relief to have some certainty. @Shunichi, I think it was a very thoughtful choice to clear Shion; it helps us focus our efforts on the others without doubt.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,George,,"I chose Shion because their strong personality could either be a great asset to the village or a dangerous distraction. By confirming Shion's identity, we can now utilize that analytical mind without hesitation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm glad we have a starting point. Since Shion is human, maybe we can all work together more easily now. @George, do you think we should trust your results completely, or is there anything else we should be careful about?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, questioning the Seer's reliability now is a waste of time. George has already committed to the role; if he's lying, he's the werewolf, but for now, we follow the lead. @George, who is your next target?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your blind faith in George is almost touching. One minute you're the clinical analyst, the next you're a loyal soldier. @George, you've played your hand. Now, let's see if the rest of us are as ""predictable"" as Shion.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I think it's okay to trust George for now. He's been very calm and helpful. Let's try to stay positive and support the Seer so we can find the werewolf together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,George,,"I appreciate your trust, Midori. As for my next target, I shall decide that tonight. For now, we must consider who among the remaining players seems most out of place. I am listening to your thoughts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't really know who to suspect. Everyone seems so different, and I'm afraid of making a mistake. Maybe we should just trust George's next result? I'll vote however the group decides... I'm sorry.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your passivity is a liability. We cannot simply wait for George to do all the work. @Shunichi, your constant cynicism is becoming a pattern. I'm voting for Shunichi; his attempts to deflect are far more suspicious than Daisuke's fear.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, jumping to conclusions because I'm not playing the role of the trembling villager? How predictable. You're so desperate for a target that you're attacking the only person here with a bit of wit. I'm not the werewolf; I'm just bored.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, please let's not rush into accusations. Shunichi is just being himself. I'm still not sure who to suspect, but I think we should be careful not to let our personalities clash and cloud our judgment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,George,,"I believe we should avoid making a decision based solely on personality clashes. While Shunichi is provocative, we have no concrete evidence. However, we must vote. I will follow the majority's lead today.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
